      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "18th Avenue, officially co‑named Cristoforo Colombo Boulevard, is the neighborhood’s symbolic heart, lined with bakeries, clothing shops and cafés.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
